In the old code at OpenAIProvider.ts, line ~501 (old numbering): `convertLinks(delta.content || '', isFirstChunk)` — the `isFirstChunk` flag was passed. The new middleware at `convertLinksMiddleware.ts:26` calls `convertLinks(chunk.textDelta)` without it.

The `isFirstChunk` parameter likely controls first-chunk-specific behavior (e.g., converting inline URLs vs. only converting anchor tags, or some initialization). Losing this parameter means the first chunk's link conversion behavior is incorrect.

